{"blocks":[["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-687","Idempotent reconcile — repeated install is safe; second run is mostly no-op when disk matches desired state.",["CLI (srcr)","Design principles"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-808","Fail closed on access — identities not allowed by config error with explicit codes in JSON, not silent skips.",["CLI (srcr)","Design principles"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-928","Global flags (intended)",["CLI (srcr)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-958","--root <path> — override source root for this invocation (see config precedence).",["CLI (srcr)","Global flags (intended)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1048","--config <path> — explicit config file path.",["CLI (srcr)","Global flags (intended)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1101","--json — machine-readable stdout for supported subcommands.",["CLI (srcr)","Global flags (intended)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1169","-q / --quiet — errors only (human scripting).",["CLI (srcr)","Global flags (intended)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1225","-v / --verbose — show git/network steps (human debugging).",["CLI (srcr)","Global flags (intended)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1294","MVP commands",["CLI (srcr)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1313","srcr install",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1336","Reconcile all [sources] entries with default install (where install is not false; MVP: all entries) against disk under root.",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr install"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1474","Use when: fresh machine, after pulling config changes, devcontainer image build, CI cache warm-up.",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr install"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1578","Behavior sketch:",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr install"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1600","Load merged config.",["MVP commands","srcr install","Behavior sketch:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1626","For each source to install: allow check (MVP: must be in [sources]) → clone or update → checkout ref.",["MVP commands","srcr install","Behavior sketch:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1742","Exit non-zero if any source failed (recommended for CI).",["MVP commands","srcr install","Behavior sketch:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1805","Does not remove repos dropped from config in MVP (avoid accidental data loss).",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr install"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","block-6a085b0f-f4f7-4b8b-92e7-2c82b657e34e","srcr status",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-1957","Compare desired vs realized state for each declared source (and optionally scan disk for undeclared trees).",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr status"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-2070","Human output: table of identity, ref wanted, ref on disk, dirty/clean, allowed, path.",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr status"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-2161","JSON: array of per-source status objects (schema aligned with use output fields; see Phase 2).",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr status"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-2263","Use when: \"why is my agent not seeing library X?\" before diving into git manually.",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr status"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-2351","srcr where <identity>",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-2383","Print resolved absolute path for one canonical identity without mutating disk.",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr where <identity>"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-2467","Use when: shell scripts, editor workspace roots, agent tool wrappers, cd \"$(srcr where …)\".",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr where <identity>"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-2568","Must work even if clone does not exist yet (path is still deterministic; exists: false in JSON mode).",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr where <identity>"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-2677","JSON reports allowed (and exists) without performing clone.",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr where <identity>"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-2746","Example:",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr where <identity>"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-2856","srcr list",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-2876","List identities from config (and optionally list materialized repos under root not in config).",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr list"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-2978","JSON: { \"configured\": [...], \"materialized\": [...] } or flat list with declared: true|false per entry.",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr list"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-3090","srcr doctor",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-3112","Preconditions: git available, root writable, config parseable, [sources] / [allow] consistent, network reachable if install will run.",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr doctor"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-3259","Reports misconfiguration early (wrong SRCR_ROOT, schema-invalid TOML, SSH agent missing for ssh clones).",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr doctor"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-3371","Use in devcontainer postCreateCommand and CI setup jobs before expensive install.",["CLI (srcr)","MVP commands","srcr doctor"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-3462","Phase 2 commands",["CLI (srcr)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-3485","Phase 2 is out of MVP scope. See Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0 AI Spec Phase 2 section.",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-3593","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-3648","Materialize one repository by identity (replaces the defunct srcr ensure); optionally with ref override flags for one-shot use outside config.",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-3798","Subject to allow policy: identity must match [sources] or an [allow] pattern.",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-3885","Optional config-mutating mode may add the identity to [sources] (see overview non-goals).",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-3982","Example:",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-4067","Example JSON (contract to stabilize in implementation):",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-4429","Field notes:",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-4447","uri — canonical identity (primary key).",["Phase 2 commands","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)","Field notes:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-4497","path — absolute resolved path.",["Phase 2 commands","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)","Field notes:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-4538","exists — directory present and looks like a git repo.",["Phase 2 commands","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)","Field notes:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-4602","cloned — whether this invocation performed a fresh clone.",["Phase 2 commands","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)","Field notes:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-4670","allowed — access policy permitted the operation.",["Phase 2 commands","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)","Field notes:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-4729","ref / ref_on_disk / dirty — optional but valuable for status-oriented agents.",["Phase 2 commands","srcr use <identity> (ad hoc materialization)","Field notes:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-4821","Other Phase 2 commands (deferred)",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-4863","srcr unuse — remove identity from config and optionally disk.",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands","Other Phase 2 commands (deferred)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-4934","srcr remove / srcr prune — delete materialized trees matching removed config entries.",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands","Other Phase 2 commands (deferred)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5031","srcr migrate — move existing non-conventional clones into canonical layout.",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands","Other Phase 2 commands (deferred)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5116","srcr index — metadata or llms.txt generation over the corpus.",["CLI (srcr)","Phase 2 commands","Other Phase 2 commands (deferred)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5191","Structured output contract",["CLI (srcr)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5224","Stdout: JSON document or JSON lines per resource when streaming many sources.",["CLI (srcr)","Structured output contract"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5306","Stderr: human-readable errors; never mix error text into JSON stdout (enables jq pipelines).",["CLI (srcr)","Structured output contract"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5405","Stable field names across use (Phase 2), status, and install summary objects.",["CLI (srcr)","Structured output contract"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5493","Version field recommended: \"schema_version\": 1 at top level for forward compatibility.",["CLI (srcr)","Structured output contract"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5586","Exit codes (illustrative):",["CLI (srcr)","Structured output contract"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5617","0 — success, all requested operations satisfied.",["CLI (srcr)","Structured output contract","Exit codes (illustrative):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5675","1 — operational failure (git error, network).",["CLI (srcr)","Structured output contract","Exit codes (illustrative):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5730","2 — not allowed (identity not in [sources] or [allow]).",["CLI (srcr)","Structured output contract","Exit codes (illustrative):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5799","3 — config parse or validation error.",["CLI (srcr)","Structured output contract","Exit codes (illustrative):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5846","Consumers",["CLI (srcr)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5862","Humans — status and doctor for everyday debugging; where for navigation.",["CLI (srcr)","Consumers"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-5951","Shell — where in scripts; install in Makefile/mise tasks.",["CLI (srcr)","Consumers"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-6025","CI — install + status --json gate merges when required sources must be present at pinned refs.",["CLI (srcr)","Consumers"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-6134","AI agents (MVP) — install, where, status --json, and list --json; planners use path + allowed without inventing /tmp clones.",["CLI (srcr)","Consumers"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-6283","AI agents (Phase 2) — use … --json for optional repos not in the install set.",["CLI (srcr)","Consumers"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-6375","Devcontainers — install during image build; doctor in postCreateCommand (see Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0 AI Spec/DevContainer).",["CLI (srcr)","Consumers"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-6537","Comparison to adjacent tools",["CLI (srcr)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-6572","Not git — does not commit, branch, or merge; may shell out to git for clone/fetch/checkout only.",["CLI (srcr)","Comparison to adjacent tools"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-6679","Not aqua / asdf — those install binaries; Sourcer installs source trees.",["CLI (srcr)","Comparison to adjacent tools"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-6766","Complements mise — mise runs srcr install as a task; Sourcer does not manage compiler versions.",["CLI (srcr)","Comparison to adjacent tools"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-6874","Lighter than git submodules for \"repos you should read\" — no submodule pointer commits required.",["CLI (srcr)","Comparison to adjacent tools"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-6981","Example end-to-end session (MVP)",["CLI (srcr)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-7277","Agent equivalent (MVP): rely on pre-installed corpus from install; use where for paths.",["CLI (srcr)","Example end-to-end session (MVP)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/CLI/","source-block-7373","Agent equivalent (Phase 2): single use call per optional library before code search tools run against path.",["CLI (srcr)","Example end-to-end session (MVP)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-0","Config (srcr.toml)",[]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-23","In the MVP, the config file is the primary interface. Humans, CI, devcontainer builds, and AI agents all converge on the same artifact: a declarative description of which source repositories should exist on disk, at which refs, under which root layout.",["Config (srcr.toml)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-279","Role in the system",["Config (srcr.toml)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-304","Sourcer separates desired state (what srcr.toml says) from realized state (what exists under the source root after srcr install).",["Config (srcr.toml)","Role in the system"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-450","That boundary mirrors mise, npm, and other tools that read a manifest and reconcile the environment.",["Config (srcr.toml)","Role in the system"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-563","Unlike a package manager, Sourcer does not resolve version graphs or build artifacts. It materializes git (and eventually other SCM) trees at stable paths keyed by canonical identity.",["Config (srcr.toml)","Role in the system"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-751","File location and discovery",["Config (srcr.toml)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-785","Project-local: srcr.toml at the repository root of the project being worked on (alongside or near mise.toml, package.json, etc.).",["Config (srcr.toml)","File location and discovery"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-925","User-global: a dotfile or XDG path for personal defaults (exact discovery TBD; precedence should favor project over user over built-in defaults).",["Config (srcr.toml)","File location and discovery"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-1075","Multiple files may merge in the future; MVP can assume a single effective config per invocation context.",["Config (srcr.toml)","File location and discovery"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-1184","Top-level keys (MVP)",["Config (srcr.toml)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-1211","root — filesystem root for all materialized sources (default ~/sources).",["Config (srcr.toml)","Top-level keys (MVP)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-1294","[sources] — table of canonical identities → ref or source object (see access policy below).",["Config (srcr.toml)","Top-level keys (MVP)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-1396","Access policy (MVP vs Phase 2)",["Config (srcr.toml)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-1433","Sourcer separates two concepts (see Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0 AI Spec/Trust):",["Config (srcr.toml)","Access policy (MVP vs Phase 2)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-1535","Install by default — identity is in [sources]; srcr install clones or updates it at the declared ref.",["Config (srcr.toml)","Access policy (MVP vs Phase 2)","Sourcer separates two concepts (see Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0 AI Spec/Trust):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-1652","Allowed to download — identity or wildcard may be materialized; identities not in [sources] need an explicit allow rule before clone (Phase 2).",["Config (srcr.toml)","Access policy (MVP vs Phase 2)","Sourcer separates two concepts (see Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0 AI Spec/Trust):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-1809","MVP: listing under [sources] means allowed and installed on install. No separate [allow] table in MVP.",["Config (srcr.toml)","Access policy (MVP vs Phase 2)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-1934","Phase 2: optional [allow] for wildcards without auto-install; optional install = false on a [sources] entry (allowed, path-resolvable, not cloned until srcr use).",["Config (srcr.toml)","Access policy (MVP vs Phase 2)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-2113","Phase 2 example:",["Config (srcr.toml)","Access policy (MVP vs Phase 2)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-2336","[sources] — declaration model",["Config (srcr.toml)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-2376","Keys use the canonical identity form <provider>/<owner>/<repository> (no scheme, no .git suffix).",["Config (srcr.toml)","[sources] — declaration model"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-2482","Values are either a ref string (happy path) or a source object (escape hatch).",["Config (srcr.toml)","[sources] — declaration model"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-2573","String form",["Config (srcr.toml)","[sources] — declaration model"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-2761","Semantics:",["Config (srcr.toml)","[sources] — declaration model","String form"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-2777","\"main\", \"v1.2.3\" — checkout that ref after clone or on update.",["[sources] — declaration model","String form","Semantics:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-2852","\"latest\" — provider-defined resolution (e.g. default branch tip); document per-provider behavior in implementation.",["[sources] — declaration model","String form","Semantics:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","block-6a085afb-5050-427b-bac3-03f0f7093063","Object form",["Config (srcr.toml)","[sources] — declaration model"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-3338","MVP object keys (intentionally small):",["Config (srcr.toml)","[sources] — declaration model","Object form"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-3382","ref — branch, tag, or commit-ish name (required when using object form).",["[sources] — declaration model","Object form","MVP object keys (intentionally small):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-3465","clone — transport preference: \"https\" | \"ssh\" (provider may default to https for public hosts).",["[sources] — declaration model","Object form","MVP object keys (intentionally small):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-3575","remote — full clone URL when identity alone is insufficient (self-hosted, non-standard paths).",["[sources] — declaration model","Object form","MVP object keys (intentionally small):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-3680","path — override local directory relative to root; use only when layout cannot follow the default convention.",["[sources] — declaration model","Object form","MVP object keys (intentionally small):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-3801","Provider defaults should derive:",["Config (srcr.toml)","[sources] — declaration model","Object form"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-3839","HTTPS clone URL from identity when remote is omitted.",["[sources] — declaration model","Object form","Provider defaults should derive:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-3901","Default path root/<identity-as-path> e.g. ~/sources/github.com/example/project.",["[sources] — declaration model","Object form","Provider defaults should derive:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-3991","Identity → URL → path (worked example)",["Config (srcr.toml)","[sources] — declaration model"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4042","Identity: github.com/acme/widget",["Config (srcr.toml)","[sources] — declaration model","Identity → URL → path (worked example)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4082","Default remote: https://github.com/acme/widget.git",["Config (srcr.toml)","[sources] — declaration model","Identity → URL → path (worked example)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4140","Default path with root = \"~/sources\": ~/sources/github.com/acme/widget",["Config (srcr.toml)","[sources] — declaration model","Identity → URL → path (worked example)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4220","Ref v2.0.0 → git fetch + git checkout v2.0.0 (exact git mechanics are implementation detail; config only names intent).",["Config (srcr.toml)","[sources] — declaration model","Identity → URL → path (worked example)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4353","Layout root (root)",["Config (srcr.toml)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4380","Default tree:",["Config (srcr.toml)","Layout root (root)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4490","Repository identity never changes when root changes; only the resolved absolute path changes.",["Config (srcr.toml)","Layout root (root)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4594","Precedence for root (highest wins):",["Config (srcr.toml)","Layout root (root)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4636","1. CLI flag e.g. srcr install --root /mnt/ssd/sources",["Config (srcr.toml)","Layout root (root)","Precedence for root (highest wins):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4697","2. Environment variable SRCR_ROOT",["Config (srcr.toml)","Layout root (root)","Precedence for root (highest wins):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4738","3. root in srcr.toml",["Config (srcr.toml)","Layout root (root)","Precedence for root (highest wins):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4768","4. Built-in default ~/sources",["Config (srcr.toml)","Layout root (root)","Precedence for root (highest wins):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4805","Examples:",["Config (srcr.toml)","Layout root (root)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-4881","Phase 2 (ad-hoc materialization):",["Config (srcr.toml)","Layout root (root)","Examples:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5116","Symmetry with mise",["Config (srcr.toml)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5145","Mental mapping:",["Config (srcr.toml)","Symmetry with mise"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5165","mise [tools] → Sourcer [sources]",["Config (srcr.toml)","Symmetry with mise","Mental mapping:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5209","mise install → srcr install",["Config (srcr.toml)","Symmetry with mise","Mental mapping:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5248","tool version pin → git ref pin",["Config (srcr.toml)","Symmetry with mise","Mental mapping:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5286","Sourcer remains a separate binary and config schema; it should not require a mise plugin to feel native.",["Config (srcr.toml)","Symmetry with mise"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5399","Recommended project pattern:",["Config (srcr.toml)","Symmetry with mise"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5620","Onboarding: mise install then mise run sources-install (or project-specific task name).",["Config (srcr.toml)","Symmetry with mise"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5716","Editor and schema affordances",["Config (srcr.toml)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5752","Ship a published JSON Schema for srcr.toml even though the on-disk format is TOML.",["Config (srcr.toml)","Editor and schema affordances"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5845","Taplo (and editors that delegate to it) can attach the schema for:",["Config (srcr.toml)","Editor and schema affordances"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5920","autocomplete on [sources] keys and object fields",["Config (srcr.toml)","Editor and schema affordances","Taplo (and editors that delegate to it) can attach the schema for:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-5976","enum validation for clone = \"https\" | \"ssh\"",["Config (srcr.toml)","Editor and schema affordances","Taplo (and editors that delegate to it) can attach the schema for:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-6027","warnings on unknown keys (guards typo-driven silent misconfig)",["Config (srcr.toml)","Editor and schema affordances","Taplo (and editors that delegate to it) can attach the schema for:"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-6095","Document a one-line editor snippet (VS Code evenBetterToml, etc.) pointing at the schema URL.",["Config (srcr.toml)","Editor and schema affordances"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-6195","Rationale: in the MVP, users spend more time editing the file than memorizing CLI flags; schema quality directly reduces support burden.",["Config (srcr.toml)","Editor and schema affordances"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-6336","Reconciliation semantics (srcr install)",["Config (srcr.toml)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-6384","For each entry in [sources] where install is not false (MVP: all entries):",["Config (srcr.toml)","Reconciliation semantics (srcr install)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-6469","Resolve identity → path and remote.",["Config (srcr.toml)","Reconciliation semantics (srcr install)","For each entry in [sources] where install is not false (MVP: all entries):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-6512","Allow check (MVP: must be listed in [sources]).",["Config (srcr.toml)","Reconciliation semantics (srcr install)","For each entry in [sources] where install is not false (MVP: all entries):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-6567","If path missing: clone at ref.",["Config (srcr.toml)","Reconciliation semantics (srcr install)","For each entry in [sources] where install is not false (MVP: all entries):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-6605","If path exists: fetch and checkout ref (idempotent; no-op when already correct).",["Config (srcr.toml)","Reconciliation semantics (srcr install)","For each entry in [sources] where install is not false (MVP: all entries):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-6693","If entry removed from config: do not delete by default in MVP (safe default); explicit prune command is a future addition.",["Config (srcr.toml)","Reconciliation semantics (srcr install)","For each entry in [sources] where install is not false (MVP: all entries):"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-6825","Partial failure: document whether install stops on first error or continues and reports aggregate status (recommend aggregate + non-zero exit for CI).",["Config (srcr.toml)","Reconciliation semantics (srcr install)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-6982","What config deliberately does not do (MVP)",["Config (srcr.toml)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0%20AI%20Spec/Config/","source-block-7031","No imperative mutation: no srcr use / srcr unuse writing the file (Phase 2; see Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0 AI Spec non-goals and Person/codekiln/GitHub/sourcer/Project/v0 AI Spec/CLI Phase 2 commands).",["Config (srcr.toml)","What config deliberately does not do (MVP)"]]],"format_version":5}